<title>FRANCE: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF HINGIS V KOURNIKOVA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF HINGIS V KOURNIKOVA.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of Saturday's French Open women's singles third round match between top seed Martina Hingis of Switzerland and Anna Kournikova of Russia (world ranking in brackets).</p>
<p>Hingis won 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Time: 42 minutes</p>
<p>    HINGIS (1)    KOURNIKOVA (47)</p>
<p>Aces 0 1</p>
